-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  lex_comments_err_nested.pcpp - break step of lex_comments.pcpp:
  a slash-star inside a block comment: no nesting (LX0203, a warning)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\lex_comments_err_nested.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\lex_comments_err_nested.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that warning; nothing else is reported.
*******************************************************************************/

module exe lex_comments_err_nested;

begin
  /* outer /* inner */ // WARN LX0203@12: '/*' within block comment
end.
